        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-045886",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We currently have two RPx product candidates in our development pipeline, RP1 (vusolimogene oderparepvec), our lead product candidate and RP2 (sturlimgene erparepvec).",
        "start_character": 1952,
        "end_character": 2119
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-045886",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-045886-2245bc2a0588da53",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-045886",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have another product candidate in the portfolio as well and have designed our RP3 product candidate to express further immune-activating proteins that stimulate T cells, in addition to anti-CTLA-4 and GALV-GP R(-).",
