        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have established an operations leadership team that we believe has extensive experience in manufacturing biologics based on viruses, including oncolytic products and gene therapy products and we operate our own in-house, approximately 63,000 square foot, U.S.",
